WEBVTT

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.990
Begin fueling.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:18.240
Keep the main computer online 
in case the enemy attacks.

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:20.750
Yeah, I know.

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:25.280
Just a little more. Hang in there, partner.

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:29.440
Red Shift? Hah! I'll stop it.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:31.440
Yuuya.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:33.490
I'm going.

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:37.010
Yeah. Can you really pilot that thing?

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:40.560
It'll be okay. I love shots.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.880
Okay, thanks.

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:47.250
You too, Cryska.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:48.770
Yeah.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:53.290
At a time like this, I'm...

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:32.610
I knew there was a direct line in the 
military's post, but it took a while to get there.

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:37.010
I'm glad you're safe.

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:40.000
You haven't gone soft even 
after you switched to research.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:44.300
But the odds aren't good this time.

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:47.340
If we don't win, it's the end of the USSR.

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:50.690
Now show us the pride of the Spetznaz.

00:02:51.340 --> 00:02:54.340
Okay, I'll send info to Delta.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:57.780
They're in as big a panic as we are.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.950
America's anti-terrorism forces.

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:03.460
They're a very enthusiastic group.

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.200
They'll be quite useful.

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:08.420
I'll leave the land battle to you.

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:10.880
Just be ready by the time 
the operation begins.

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:13.710
Roger. See you later then.

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:15.560
For the motherland!

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:20.220
The USSR doesn't matter.

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:26.340
I don't know who's behind this, but 
I won't let them interfere with me.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:31.730
<b>The Victory Song of the Dead</b>

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:37.560
Displaying the predicted route 
of the BETA we released.

00:03:39.050 --> 00:03:41.580
There's so many. What's going on?

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:43.320
Wasn't it supposed to just be laser class?

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:47.330
What do we do? At this rate 
Red Shift will activate!

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:49.900
This isn't our war.

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:51.440
I know that.

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:52.600
But...

00:03:53.050 --> 00:03:58.690
Turn over all your information to the US 
and Soviet governments and ask for help!

00:03:58.690 --> 00:03:59.460
Now!

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:00.580
What?

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:01.840
Who said you could talk!

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:05.170
If a certain amount of the 
larger BETAs get over the line,

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:06.850
it's all over!

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:11.350
Over 2000 bombs the size of 
the Tsar Bomba will go off!

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:14.820
It won't just be the end of the USSR.

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:22.050
The US, the world's biggest source of food and 
weapons, North America, will be on the front lines!

00:04:22.050 --> 00:04:23.110
Do you understand?

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:27.870
Millions of lives lost in an 
instant when Red Shift goes off!

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:32.620
And humanity going extinct 
from lack of food and weapons!

00:04:33.020 --> 00:04:37.960
And most of the ones who die will be 
the poor you're trying to protect!

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:46.770
You're a very humane person, Commander.

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:47.970
What?

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:53.140
Why were those feelings never 
directed at the refugees?

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:56.140
It's such a shame.

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:02.150
Capturing the Com Center and HQ, which 
is the primary goal of this campaign,

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:05.360
will be handled by US and 
Soviet Special Forces.

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:08.160
But the question is how to get in.

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:11.720
Both sides have TSFs deployed on the routes.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:16.160
In other words, our feint 
will determine everything.

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:19.280
Furthermore, the primary 
goal is the Com Center.

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:23.550
We'll take it over and end the jamming 
that's stopping our satellites.

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:28.770
With the satellite datalink back up, both 
the US and USSR will know what's going on.

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:32.060
They'll be able to plan a better 
attack against the BETAs.

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:35.170
Right now that's our only hope.

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:39.340
Once the assault squads 
are inside the facility,

00:05:39.760 --> 00:05:42.930
we will attempt to delay the BETA attack.

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.570
Lilifort will be the 
primary location of this.

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:49.100
Their advance will be slowed 
considerably in the city.

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:52.480
We will knock out as many of 
the larger ones as we can,

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:54.760
particularly the fast-moving Destroyers.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:56.460
Wait a second.

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.490
There's still tens of 
thousands of people there.

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:03.340
Better them than the whole 
population of Alaska.

00:06:05.530 --> 00:06:08.630
If you can't take everything, decide 
what you're going to throw away.

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:10.100
I know that.

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:13.220
And I know that's the burden you carried.

00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:16.390
This is the big moment.

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:19.640
It's going to be a hard fight.

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:25.150
But we are the one chance the 
world has to avert destruction.

00:06:26.200 --> 00:06:28.050
I expect your best.

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:35.400
TSFs! 5 of them!

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:37.410
My squad will take it.

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:39.900
Don't move the Falcons.

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:42.670
Watch out for another attack.

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:44.060
Roger!

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:51.780
Lástočka!

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:53.280
From 12 to 3 o' clock.

00:06:53.280 --> 00:06:54.320
36 of them.

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:56.940
Three Fulcrum's from 9 o'clock!

00:06:58.010 --> 00:06:59.680
One unknown?

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:01.310
Here we go!

00:07:01.610 --> 00:07:03.940
All units, weapons free!

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:12.640
Major, they've split up!

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:15.850
They're probably after the 
HQ and the Com Center.

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:17.450
Pretend to fall for it.

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:22.250
2 o' clock. 8 lástočka.

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:23.900
We'll tear them apart.

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:25.000
Follow me.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:25.820
Roger!

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:49.480
They say the Eishi here 
are the best in the world.

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:52.240
Let's see how good you are!

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:59.120
He talked to us on an open channel?

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:22.520
Argos 2!

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:23.970
I know!

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:39.030
Dodge!

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:57.760
Pretty fast.

00:08:58.460 --> 00:09:00.390
That's a good machine.

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:05.130
He's good!

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:23.160
The army's made it inside!

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:25.910
Okay. Everyone fall back.

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:27.530
We'll hit the BETA!

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.930
A mere autonomous program...

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:03.090
Not yet.

00:10:03.480 --> 00:10:06.220
Now's not the time to use the Prafka yet.

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:15.140
Com Center defense squads 
are requesting help.

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:16.880
A surprise assault by special forces!

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:20.890
Send the mechanized troops that 
are withdrawing from Lilfort!

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:22.570
They won't make it!

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:24.720
Surrender-

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:26.900
You're in the way.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:28.200
Get them out of here.

00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:34.060
The main gate's been broken through.

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:38.220
It won't be long until they 
make it to the blast doors.

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:45.700
What are you-

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:47.050
Be quick!

00:10:47.340 --> 00:10:48.960
If Valentine finds out there'll be trouble.

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.290
Who are you?

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:04.140
Are you hurt, Commander?

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:23.890
Fight for real!

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:25.830
Or I'll kill you right away!

00:11:26.420 --> 00:11:28.260
I'll handle the leader unit.

00:11:28.260 --> 00:11:29.650
You guys get the BETA!

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:32.040
He's a veteran! You can't win!

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:33.890
I'll be fine.

00:11:33.890 --> 00:11:35.120
Go, Yui!

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:54.480
Are you sure about this?

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:58.520
He said he was okay.

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:04.250
Yuuya wouldn't lie to me.

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:08.890
The first BETA scouts have reached the city!

00:12:14.480 --> 00:12:19.670
What am I doing?

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.450
Stop it, Mariem!

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:22.550
You can't go that way!

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:26.130
The main BETA force is approaching.

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:28.200
It's a group of Grapplers!

00:12:30.490 --> 00:12:31.690
Major Christopher!

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:33.060
Come in!

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:41.480
Major! This is Valentine!

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:42.800
Major!

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:44.780
I can hear you!

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:45.820
What is it?

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:48.850
Our first priority is to stop 
Red Shift from activating.

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:50.620
Attack the BETA.

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:53.940
We'll call a ceasefire with the enemy.

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:56.710
Sorry, I'm an Allegiance member.

00:12:57.240 --> 00:13:00.450
The BETA are servants of 
God. I won't attack them.

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:02.210
Major!

00:13:02.530 --> 00:13:04.970
Yeah right.

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:06.020
Major!

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:07.730
Major Christopher!

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:09.860
The line's been blocked!

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:12.770
We can't contact any of the TSFs!

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:14.450
No...

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:15.350
What's going on?

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:17.290
That's right.

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:18.300
I'll contact the Master.

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:20.360
Open the direct line to the Master.

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:23.320
It's not working.

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:24.280
I can't reach him.

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:26.570
Try one more time. Again!

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.560
I am trying! But...

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:31.700
No...

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:51.550
The Scarlet Twins?

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:54.640
The attack on the Com Center succeeded.

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:57.140
We will pursue the BETA that broke through.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:58.350
Thank you.

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:03.570
Major, the prey's in the trap.

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:04.770
Okay.

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:07.050
I'll head to the trap with the net.

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:10.530
Play with them a little more 
and then you can kill them.

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:12.370
Then follow the plan.

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:13.980
Ja, Commander!

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:17.360
Fool! I told you to use English here!

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:21.050
Wait! Where are you going?

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:27.440
You're not going to let me follow?

00:14:27.440 --> 00:14:30.300
I'm running low on ammo, too!

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:33.930
Damn it!

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:37.180
Do you not care what happens to the world?

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:05.920
I won't let you pass!

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:10.660
Wait, Yui!

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.760
Even with the mobility of the Type 0...

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:31.030
Yui!

00:15:58.010 --> 00:15:59.560
Looks like you need some help.

00:16:01.300 --> 00:16:04.560
Christ... I can't bear to watch.

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:09.120
The F-22... Raptor?

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:22.580
Those stealth bastards are still alive?

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:26.080
We were taking care of those Laser Class.

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:27.690
We'll take the TSFs.

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:30.220
You follow the BETA.

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:33.720
We'll borrow Yuuya so we 
can finish this quick.

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:39.240
You idiot, you're the only one 
who can work with us effectively.

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:40.850
Okay.

00:16:41.090 --> 00:16:42.680
We need every second right now.

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:45.480
We'll be waiting for you.

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:48.660
Yeah, I'm counting on you.

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:49.730
Leave it to us!

00:16:57.200 --> 00:17:00.210
Now then, we made a big entrance,

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:04.500
but we actually just finished a 
mission and are running low on fuel.

00:17:04.860 --> 00:17:07.380
Then let's do this fast.

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:10.640
I think that's best for my mental health.

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.810
For both of us.

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:16.630
Top Element's back in business!

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:27.100
It's only a few minutes to the border.

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:31.770
I'll active Prafka and 
destroy the BETA there.

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:35.360
Even then the situation is dire.

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:38.530
It's all up to you.

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:40.570
Be ready for the order!

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:41.530
Roger.

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:45.210
Hey, Cryska...

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:48.560
What do you want to protect?

00:17:50.780 --> 00:17:54.040
The party and the motherland... 
and you, Inia.

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:55.720
And?

00:17:57.610 --> 00:17:59.820
I know.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:03.060
Because you and I are one.

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:10.060
That's right. The two of us are one.

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:11.610
Yeah.

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:18.010
I don't know why I think this.

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:21.040
But I want to protect him...

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:28.850
I want to protect the world 
where Yuuya Bridges lives.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:33.240
I truly believe that right now.

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:37.690
Let's become one and protect Yuuya's world.

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:42.720
20 minutes until the BETA hit the red line.

00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:44.350
Damn it!

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:46.580
Why did this happen?

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:49.100
Let's end this.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:52.000
We've failed.

00:18:52.730 --> 00:18:57.840
No, we were simply used and then abandoned.

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:04.720
At this rate the RLF will 
be blamed for mass murder.

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:06.940
We must prevent that from happening.

00:19:07.780 --> 00:19:09.560
Even if it means humiliating ourselves,

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:14.020
we must show the world that we were used.

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:20.720
Message to all units.

00:19:21.210 --> 00:19:23.300
Cease combat immediately and surrend-

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:35.500
Shut up, you traitor!

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:37.820
We've gone too far to go back now!

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:39.170
You bastard!

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:46.220
No!

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:47.340
I don't want to die-

00:19:52.530 --> 00:19:54.000
Attention all units.

00:19:54.680 --> 00:19:56.000
We have won.

00:19:56.610 --> 00:19:59.000
Repeat. We have won.

00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:31.730
It's finally time.

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:38.040
The fate of humanity is in my hands.

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:41.120
Idar Leader to Idar 1.

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:44.020
You are permitted to release the Prafka.

00:20:44.020 --> 00:20:45.570
Annihilate the BETA.

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:49.360
What's wrong?

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:50.930
What are you doing?

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:55.060
Requesting permission to release 
the limiters on the Prafka.

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:56.170
What?

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:59.620
There's no other way to survive this.

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:03.770
But if I do that, you'll...

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:05.970
I'm aware.

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.970
That is why I was created.

00:21:12.650 --> 00:21:15.740
Prevent Red Shift from being 
activated at all costs.

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:17.790
Go!

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.440
Thank you.

00:21:23.520 --> 00:21:25.220
Why would they...

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:28.900
Do they have a self of their own?

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:31.080
Impossible.

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:32.760
Simply impossible.

00:21:35.340 --> 00:21:36.620
Let's go, Inia.

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:37.500
Yeah!

00:21:46.560 --> 00:21:50.650
I've been waiting for this moment!

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:02.490
Where am I?

00:22:06.810 --> 00:22:07.800
Inia?

00:22:09.020 --> 00:22:10.380
Cryska...

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:14.090
No...

00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:16.860
Then who's over there?

00:24:05.900 --> 00:24:10.140
I think I've only started to walk 
my own path since I've come here.

00:24:10.650 --> 00:24:15.680
That's because everyone I met 
here accepted me for who I was.

00:24:16.320 --> 00:24:20.980
So now I want to return to 
you what was given to me.

00:24:16.970 --> 00:24:24.270
<b>White Darkness</b>

00:24:20.980 --> 00:24:24.270
Next time on Total Eclipse: White Darkness.
